x3 T1 [[Legendary Weapons|Legendaries]]  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=legendary}}'''Frozen''' is a {{C|Legendary|legendary}} knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it in the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It was also the weapon used to craft the [[Nightsky (Effect)|Nightsky]] effect.

== Appearance ==
This knife features a blue blade engraved with intricate swirling patterns that extend across the entire surface. The handle matches the blade with the same blue coloration and swirling decorative design. A blue guard separates the blade and handle.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Frozen Gun (2025)|matching gun]] under the same name.
